		(property "Description" "1024-stage low-noise BBD analog delay line (DIP-8). Pin-compatible drop-in replacement for the Panasonic MN3007 (same pin/function assignment, pin 2 relabeled CP4 vs MN3007's CP1) - BUT supply polarity is REVERSED: V3207D runs off a single positive supply (VDD = +4..+10V, GND = 0V reference), while the MN3007 requires negative VDD/VGG rails referenced to GND. Do not simply swap the chip into an MN3007 circuit without also reworking the supply/bias network."
